<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Protection Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the protection sphere guard and strengthen: they raise your abilities, shield you from fire, cold, lightning, poison and acid or from the mind, protect you from good or evil, keep you from hunger and thirst, lock and unlock, and break other magic. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist protection spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>raise magic              conjurer 0, sorcerer 0
raise divine             necromancer 0, healer 4
strength                 conjurer 10, sorcerer 10
dexterity                sorcerer 4, conjurer 6, assassin 30
constitution             sorcerer 6, conjurer 8
charisma                 healer 6
brain                    conjurer 2, sorcerer 2
divine resistance        healer 4
summoning resistance     no guild teaches it
awaken                   healer 7
mind shield              sorcerer 5, conjurer 14
heat resistance          sorcerer 6, conjurer 15
cold resistance          sorcerer 7, conjurer 16
electricity resistance   sorcerer 8, conjurer 17
poison resistance        sorcerer 9, conjurer 18
acid resistance          sorcerer 10, conjurer 19
protection from evil     healer 22, paladin 32
sanctuary                healer 10, paladin 30
dispel magic             sorcerer 17, conjurer 30
sustain                  necromancer 3, healer 6, paladin 18, druid 22
lock                     conjurer 14, sorcerer 16, thief 40
unlock                   sorcerer 18, conjurer 27, thief 35
protection from good     dark knight 32, necromancer 33
life protection          druid 14, healer 17
sacred                   no guild teaches it
hammer hand              no guild teaches it
raise hitpoints          healer 75, paladin 85
wizard mark              sorcerer 80
displace magic           dark knight 80
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
